OPTIONS DEFAULT
AppWareText 'COMMENT1' 'Basic Metric preview Isodraft options file'
AppWareText 'COMMENT2' unset
AppWareText 'COMMENT3' unset
AppWareText 'COMMENT4' unset
AppWareText 'COMMENT5' unset
AppWareText 'COMMENT6' unset
AppWareText 'COMMENT7' unset
AppWareText 'COMMENT8' unset
AppWareText 'COMMENT9' unset
AppWareText 'COMMENT10' unset
AppWareText 'RENAME' 'unset'
MM Bore
MM Distance
Precision Bores NOMINAL
CuttingList  ON PERDRAWING OFF ITEMCODES OFF ENDPREPARATIONS OFF
Cutmarks  OFF
Charheight 2.5mm
HYPERPLANT  ON
Date UK
Dimdistance String 11mm
Dimdistance Overall 16mm
Dimdistance Supports 6mm
Dimensions ON
Dimensions Composite OFF
Dimensions Overall  OFF
Dimensions Hangers ALONGSIDE strings
Dimlabels IN
 Supports  STRING
Margin  LEFT 5mm
Margin  RIGHT 5mm
Margin  TOP 5mm
Margin  BOTTOM 5mm
Size  A2
FlowArrows ON
FlowArrows Inline Scale 8
Frame ON
Reserve 0mm
Reserve MaterialList 0mm
FallingLines  DEGREES 5 AccuracyLevel  0
AngleAccuracy  0
LooseFlangeAllowance 150mm
Isotype  COMBINE
File  "%PDMSUSER%\previewIsoStd"  SINGLE
File SET PDF Noview Comp Colourplus Bindpages
File SET PRINT Nofit Dialog Colourplus Bindpages
File SET IMAGE PNG Colourplus Bindpages
File SET EMF Colourplus Bindpages
TTFont OFF
TTFont 5
Units  METRIC
Mark Detail  OFF
Mark Revision  OFF
Mark Ignore  ON
PlottingScale  100
PictureScale  100
Stacking  1  ALONG
Split  100  PERCENT
SpoolNumbers  ON
ISO  3
Wastage AREA 1 1
Wastage AREA 2 1
Wastage AREA 3 1
Wastage AREA 4 1
Wastage AREA 5 1
Wastage AREA 6 1
Wastage AREA 7 1
Wastage AREA 8 1
Wastage AREA 9 1
Weldnumbers Charheight 2.1mm ALL FROMDB AWELDS ELLIPSE
Weldid OFF
Weldtype  ON
Underlayplot  OFF ALL
SymbolFile Off
MessageFile "%PDMSUSER%\messFAB" OVERWRITE
TransferFile  OFF
CllengthFile  OFF
CutpipelistFile  OFF
SupportFile  OFF
MatlistFile "%PDMSUSER%\materialList" APPEND with 55 lines
MatControl  OFF
MaterialList  ON
MaterialList  DRWG
MaterialList  RIGHT  DESCRIPTION
MaterialList Charheight 2.5mm  Lspacing  100
MaterialList PartNumbers FROMDB TOTALLED
MaterialList TableDefinition Column 1 PARTNUMBER with Width 3
Column 2 BORE with Width 8
Column 3 OTHER Heading 'ANG.'  ANGL  with Width 4
Column 4 ITEMCODE with Width 29
Column 5 DESCRIPTION with Width 40
Column 6 OTHER Heading 'WEIGHT'  WEIG  with Width 6 Total Fabrication Total Erection Total Combined Factor 1 TubeFactor 1
Column 7 QUANTITY in Millimetres with Width 8
CompipeFile  OFF
Compipe MTO DRWG
Compipe Itemcodes USER
Compipe Descriptions SHORT
Compipe Supports ON

if(!!module().productfamily.upCase() eq 'MARINE') then
  Title 1 'SHIP: _'
else
  Title 1 'PROJ: _'
endif

Title 2 'SYSTEM: _'
Title 3 'ZONE: _'
Title 4 'PIPING SPEC: _'
Title 5 'DATE: _'
Title 6 'DRAWN: _'

Atext 210 ''
Atext 220 ''
Atext 250 'DATE'
Atext 251 'PROJECT NO'
Atext 252 'ZONE'
Atext 253 ''
Atext 254 ''
Atext 255 ''
Atext 256 ''
Atext 270 ''
Atext 271 ''
Atext 272 ''
Atext 289 ''
